  "extract": "The Serpentine Galleries are two contemporary art galleries in Kensington Gardens, Westminster, Greater London. Recently rebranded to just Serpentine, the organisation is split across Serpentine South and Serpentine North.",
  "extract_html": "<p>The <b>Serpentine Galleries</b> are two contemporary art galleries in Kensington Gardens, Westminster, Greater London. Recently rebranded to just Serpentine, the organisation is split across Serpentine South and Serpentine North.</p>"
